WEBVTT

00:10:28.436 --> 00:10:31.876
And then I can evaluate
how the organization responds to me.

00:10:31.876 --> 00:10:35.236
DP: The first thing that stands out to me
as you're sharing your story,

00:10:35.276 --> 00:10:39.036
is this idea that a lot of women of color
I interviewed, especially Black women,

00:10:39.076 --> 00:10:43.036
were told that they had to be two
and four times as ready, right?

00:10:43.076 --> 00:10:45.156
You have to work twice
or four times as hard

00:10:45.156 --> 00:10:47.996
just to even be seen as qualified.

00:10:48.036 --> 00:10:52.516
There was such a message of overworking
amongst the women of color I interviewed,

00:10:52.516 --> 00:10:55.276
and this idea of perfection
and having everything prepared

00:10:55.276 --> 00:10:57.716
and being buttoned up
and almost overprepared,

00:10:57.756 --> 00:11:01.236
because at some point your qualifications
will be called into question.